<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-TF1 rated &quot;sell&quot; at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-TF1 rated &quot;sell&quot; at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>TF1 was rated &quot;sell&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, a research note by analysts Christopher Renaud and Paul Brilliant said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock was trading down 2.6 percent at 530 francs from Friday's close of 544 francs.  </p>
<p>The note said TF1 was overvalued based on its core growth prospects in French television advertising, and that the stock &quot;implicity trades at a significant premium to the returns its invested capital base can generate over a reasonable investment cycle.&quot;</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
